cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the version-specific Zenodo release when available."
title: "Country war experience case selection: Data and R scripts"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Orlov"
    given-names: "Oleh"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-01
repository-code: "https://github.com/OrlovOleh/country-war-experience-case-selection"
url: "https://github.com/OrlovOleh/country-war-experience-case-selection"
abstract: >-
  Replication materials for a cross-national study of state war experience
  as a multidimensional criterion for systematic case selection, with Ukraine
  as the reference case. The repository contains a derived country-level
  analytical workbook, hierarchical cluster analysis scripts, variable-
  importance analysis, and the principal figure-generation script.
keywords:
  - war experience
  - case selection
  - cross-national comparison
  - hierarchical cluster analysis
  - Ukraine
